## Endpoints & Schemas
- POST /voice/initiate (Farfalle Backend)
  - Body: { contact_id?: string, phone?: string, topic?: string, context?: string, allow_live_calls?: boolean }
  - Behavior: if contact_id, resolve via CRM adapter; enforce VOICE_SANDBOX (block non-whitelisted unless ALLOW_LIVE_CALLS=true)
  - Returns: { call_id: string, provider: 'twilio'|'vapi', status: 'initiated'|'queued' }
- POST /voice/end (Farfalle Backend)
  - Body: { call_id: string }
  - Returns: { ok: true }
- POST /webhooks/twilio (Farfalle Backend)
  - Source: Twilio StatusCallback
  - Idempotency: key = CallSid
  - Action: upsert `CRM Call Log` via CRM adapter (started_at, ended_at, duration, status, provider_call_id)
  - Returns: { ok: true, call_log_name?: string }
- POST /webhooks/vapi (Farfalle Backend)
  - Source: Vapi agent events/transcripts
  - Idempotency: key = eventId (or composed callId+timestamp)
  - Action: buffer transcript chunks; on call_ended – create `FCRM Note` (and optional `ToDo`) via CRM adapter
  - Returns: { ok: true, note_name?: string, todo_name?: string }
- POST /intel/enrich_lead (Farfalle Backend)
  - Body: { company: string, domain?: string }
  - Action: call IntelligenceService.analyze → normalize → summarize
  - Returns: normalized intel with 3–6 bullet summary + sources

## CRM DocTypes Mapping
- Call Log (create/update)
  - Fields: provider_call_id (CallSid), from, to, started_at, ended_at, duration, status, reference_doctype, reference_name
- Note (or Comment)
  - Fields: reference_doctype/reference_name, title (e.g., "Call Summary"), content (summarized transcript)
- ToDo (follow-up task)
  - Fields: reference_doctype/reference_name, description, allocated_to, date (due)

