## Data Flow (Call Scenario)
1) User: "Call John Test, discuss proposal"
2) Farfalle resolves contact via CRM adapter (Contacts)
3) initiate_call → Twilio/Vapi places call
4) During call: /webhooks/vapi receives transcript chunks → buffer and (optionally) summarize draft
5) On call end: /webhooks/twilio receives completion → upsert Call Log; /webhooks/vapi finalizes Note + ToDo
6) Response to chat includes links to CRM artifacts (/app/crm-call-log/<name>, /app/todo/<name>)

## Staging & Safety
- Use Twilio test credentials/sandbox numbers
- VOICE_SANDBOX=true blocks dialing non-whitelisted numbers
- ALLOW_LIVE_CALLS=false until explicitly enabled
- Never fetch real numbers from CRM unless ALLOW_LIVE_CALLS=true

## PII & Logging Policy
- Never log raw transcripts; only log event meta (call_id, duration, status)
- Redact phone numbers in logs beyond last 2–4 digits
- Store summaries in CRM Note; raw transcripts optional and only with explicit consent

## Idempotency & Retries
- Webhooks must be idempotent: use CallSid/eventId to guard duplicate processing
- Retry/backoff on 429/5xx with exponential strategy (short jitter)

